{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事、学校に、宿題で最近忙しくて更新おくれてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてくれてる方、\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログも途中まで書いてて、そのままだったから、これからのは今日の事ではないのもあるよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、前以上にまいやん(白石まいちゃん)と絡んでるまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、\nまあやがまいやんに対して悪い口調で話したりすると..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん\n『はい！マイナス10点〜』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じで、今日なんか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん\n『あっ！触ったなぁー！マイナス100〜』笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとか言ってくる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは一緒にいて楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の楽屋も、まいやんの横に座ってたり、バスでもまいやんの前に座ったりっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！まあやが前に座ったとき\n思いっきりイス揺らしてきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあやだけイス揺れてるよ(>_<)笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとか言ってくるの！笑\nまいやんのバカーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！マイナスになっちゃう！\nだいすきだよー！(o^−^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば一実んにもなにもしてないのに\n『マイナス〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていわれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人は本当に綺麗なのはもちろんだけど、お茶目で、優しいし、面白いお姉ちゃんだよ♪\nだからメンバーからも慕われててすごいなっ！っておもう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は素敵なお姉ちゃんが沢山〜♪\nまあやも見習わなくちゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓まいやんに書かれた〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンクイズ\n当たった方いたみたいでビックリです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前個別握手会の時の服装で、\n『マネキン買いしたよ』\nって言うのを覚えててくださった方がいて、それをたよりに考えた\nって方もいてこれまたビックリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまたビックリなこと\n乃木ここでMVPをまあやにしてくださった方がいて\nアメイジング〜♪ヽ(´▽｀)/\nアメイジングといば高山の一実さんー！\n大好きスキーな♪かずみん♪みん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁー今日は、\n岡山でイベント\nだったのー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃめちゃ沢山の人来てくれてるしさぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやTシャツ着てる人とか、まあやって書いたうちわ持ってる人いて幸せだったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪\n声援も嬉しかったです〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に歌ったり、踊ったり♪\nいつも温かいし、楽しいライブをさせてもらえて感謝しています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様も楽しんでもらえてたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族や友達とも久しぶりに逢えて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの友達が、乃木坂familyの方からサイリウムをもらって一緒に声援したのが楽しかった〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたい♪って言ってくれてました。\n優しくしてくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと...\n実は母さんも、皆が　おいでシャンプー　のとき踊ってくれてたから...皆と踊ってみたかった♪って言ってたよ...笑笑トホホ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しいイベントでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方もいつも応援ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度あえるのを楽しみに待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつも沢山のコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてブログを楽しみに待って下さってたり、漢字の間違いを教えてくれたりしてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントはいつものように１人１人を思い出したり想像したりして大切に読ませてもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初コメの方もいて♪嬉しい気持ちです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに昔のコメントも読んだりしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のパワーをもらってるから、\nまあやは今までやってこれたよ\nいつも温かい言葉をまあやに言ってくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやに届いてるパワーが\n皆にも届けれてたらいいな〜\nじゃあ今回も行くよ〜!!\n「まあやパワー〜〜え〜い!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体には気を付けて下さいね♪\n明日も頑張り〜まあや〜!!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、キレイなお月様見ましたか？\nうさぎさんはいた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/9159733/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}